                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29b5141f-0c03-3966-93a9-c684a2333057",
                                        "entry_id": "41e6d61d-b0e8-37a4-8f41-987b7cab6e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being inept."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5123ac95-9c7e-49a1-b154-1b69dd9a8169",
                                                "sense_id": "29b5141f-0c03-3966-93a9-c684a2333057",
                                                "text": "The curse has been Spanish ineptitude feeding Gibraltarian intransigence. Border hold-ups are counterproductive to winning hearts and minds, as were blundering Argentinian landings on the outer Falklands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a2d8daf-6fe8-3096-9fc0-70782ceea190",
                                        "entry_id": "41e6d61d-b0e8-37a4-8f41-987b7cab6e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of being inept."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec9882f8-c6fa-4d6b-94c5-4c50cdd4b075",
                                                "sense_id": "8a2d8daf-6fe8-3096-9fc0-70782ceea190",
                                                "text": "He droned on with platitudes and ineptitudes while Malone whispered to Enid that if Alasha was a fair specimen of the population it was just as well that his native land was safely engulfed in the Atlantic Ocean."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1762fc7c-054a-4cbd-859c-d97ec4740946",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b5df7cf-50f2-3a30-84e5-dc0f51840d30",
                        "source_sense_id": "49fe6bf1-4efa-36ce-a07a-2ecbd10152a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "inappropriateness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inappropriateness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab24f78d-71cf-3080-8b68-db723d3cc32d",
                                        "entry_id": "d86f895d-f9e3-3550-9f76-5b9aebbb2090",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being inappropriate; unsuitability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e32344d-2a03-4834-9311-243357c02ea3",
                                                "sense_id": "ab24f78d-71cf-3080-8b68-db723d3cc32d",
                                                "text": "The station is seven miles from South Molton, and reference to the inappropriateness of its former name was made in the article on the naming of railway stations, by Mr. M. D. Greville, which appeared in the March issue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5c0a621-7003-4be0-b37b-dd141349d02c",
                                                "sense_id": "ab24f78d-71cf-3080-8b68-db723d3cc32d",
                                                "text": "I suppose thatʼs what I first loved about Marpessa, her unabashed inappropriateness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aba063ea-725e-34a0-a3e9-456fff241787",
                                        "entry_id": "d86f895d-f9e3-3550-9f76-5b9aebbb2090",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The result of being inappropriate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8ef469b-4a6b-4de8-93bb-4bda7801140f",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b5df7cf-50f2-3a30-84e5-dc0f51840d30",
                        "source_sense_id": "49fe6bf1-4efa-36ce-a07a-2ecbd10152a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "malpropreté",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "malpropreté",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7b33c2f-1708-34c4-82f5-e9d5704c50f2",
                                        "entry_id": "18be4097-7b7d-37f1-b6f2-28b832d22ebb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Défaut de propreté, saleté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "388b2d0a-7393-46fb-918c-4470bef672e2",
                                                "sense_id": "c7b33c2f-1708-34c4-82f5-e9d5704c50f2",
                                                "text": "Sa chambre est d’une grande malpropreté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55a395e0-9087-3885-9112-e2a7a45a1b1d",
                                        "entry_id": "18be4097-7b7d-37f1-b6f2-28b832d22ebb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parole ou action contraire à la morale, à l’honnêteté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34eb7be2-dbda-48d8-a4d0-bcaffaf98032",
                                                "sense_id": "55a395e0-9087-3885-9112-e2a7a45a1b1d",
                                                "text": "Enfin, que voulez-vous attendre de cette exécrable Chambre ? Il s’y trame sûrement quelque malpropreté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ee2215e-98fc-4352-a794-9991ce2b4c2a",
                                                "sense_id": "55a395e0-9087-3885-9112-e2a7a45a1b1d",
                                                "text": "Apprends, Pomme d'Api, que les grandes personnes ont le droit de faire entre elles les plus grosses malpropretés. Je ne sais pas ce qu'elles font : mais aux précautions qu'elles prennent pour nous le cacher, il faut que cela soit abominable..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9f0f6d8-5d37-42db-b31c-e372becdb302",
                                                "sense_id": "55a395e0-9087-3885-9112-e2a7a45a1b1d",
                                                "text": "Il n’ignorait pas les malpropretés auxquelles donne souvent lieu l’attribution de la Légion d’honneur à des industriels, à des commerçants, à des financiers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bd25541-963b-462a-9893-36bfc9dcbba4",
                                                "sense_id": "55a395e0-9087-3885-9112-e2a7a45a1b1d",
                                                "text": "J’ignorais leurs malpropretés morales et physiques, leurs tares, leurs perversions de tout ordre qui les souillaient, quelles abominations pouvaient s’y perpétrer et jusqu’où se dégradaient les sentiments les plus sacrés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
